25:["$","p","Ask whether heating, electricity, water, internet and condominium charges are included. Seasonal heating and cooling can change the monthly pattern. Keep a reasonable contingency based on your contract and actual risks rather than presenting one fixed percentage as compulsory.",{"children":"Ask whether heating, electricity, water, internet and condominium charges are included. Seasonal heating and cooling can change the monthly pattern. Keep a reasonable contingency based on your contract and actual risks rather than presenting one fixed percentage as compulsory."}]
26:["$","p",null,{"className":"table-source","children":["Official reference: ",[["$","span","https://www.unipd.it/en/costo-vita-padova",{"children":["",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://www.unipd.it/en/costo-vita-padova","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"Padua living-cost examples"}]]}],["$","span","https://www.unibo.it/en/study/life-at-university-and-in-the-city/living-in-the-city/living-costs-in-bologna",{"children":[" · ",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://www.unibo.it/en/study/life-at-university-and-in-the-city/living-in-the-city/living-costs-in-bologna","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"Bologna living-cost examples"}]]}]]]}]
27:["$","section","4-Subsidised residence and scholarship accommodation are different cases",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-5","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Subsidised residence and scholarship accommodation are different cases"}],[["$","p","A subsidised place may materially reduce costs, but eligibility, allocation, contract duration and availability need confirmation. A scholarship application or ranking is not evidence that you already have a room. Keep a private-housing fallback until the actual benefit and arrival arrangement are confirmed.",{"children":"A subsidised place may materially reduce costs, but eligibility, allocation, contract duration and availability need confirmation. A scholarship application or ranking is not evidence that you already have a room. Keep a private-housing fallback until the actual benefit and arrival arrangement are confirmed."}],["$","p","If a benefit supplies a room or meals in kind, represent the reduced cost carefully. Do not subtract the full rent and also add the same housing benefit as cash. Cash awards also need a payment schedule before they can solve an arrival-cash problem.",{"children":"If a benefit supplies a room or meals in kind, represent the reduced cost carefully. Do not subtract the full rent and also add the same housing benefit as cash. Cash awards also need a payment schedule before they can solve an arrival-cash problem."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for Subsidised residence and scholarship accommodation are different cases","children":[["$","$L4","/guides/italy-dsu-scholarships/",{"href":"/guides/italy-dsu-scholarships/","children":["DSU benefits and eligibility",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$8:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L4","/guides/dsu-italy-deadlines-by-region/",{"href":"/guides/dsu-italy-deadlines-by-region/","children":["Regional deadlines and current status",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$8:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}]
28:["$","section","5-Arrival cash is not another monthly city cost",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-6","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Arrival cash is not another monthly city cost"}],[["$","p","A refundable deposit, travel and initial setup can create a large first-month cash requirement without being recurring expenses. Record lease refund terms and the number of rent payments required before arrival. Do not spread an assumed refundable deposit into the same table as ordinary monthly spending without explaining the model.",{"children":"A refundable deposit, travel and initial setup can create a large first-month cash requirement without being recurring expenses. Record lease refund terms and the number of rent payments required before arrival. Do not spread an assumed refundable deposit into the same table as ordinary monthly spending without explaining the model."}],["$","p","Use the national Italy budget guide for the detailed EUR 950 worked budget and pre-payment cash example. This city guide helps select comparable inputs; the national guide explains how monthly, annual and upfront figures fit together.",{"children":"Use the national Italy budget guide for the detailed EUR 950 worked budget and pre-payment cash example. This city guide helps select comparable inputs; the national guide explains how monthly, annual and upfront figures fit together."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for Arrival cash is not another monthly city cost","children":[["$","$L4","/guides/cost-of-living-in-italy-for-students/",{"href":"/guides/cost-of-living-in-italy-for-students/","children":["Monthly, annual and arrival-cash method",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$8:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L4","/tools/italy-study-cost-calculator/",{"href":"/tools/italy-study-cost-calculator/","children":["Calculate your Italy study budget",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$8:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}]
29:["$","section","6-Before accepting a housing quote",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-7","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Before accepting a housing quote"}],[["$","p","The lowest number is useful only if the room is real, the lease works for your study period and the commute is practical. Ask the housing office about vetted starting points and verify the actual offer independently.",{"children":"The lowest number is useful only if the room is real, the lease works for your study period and the commute is practical. Ask the housing office about vetted starting points and verify the actual offer independently."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","$L2d",null,{"id":"guides/cost-of-living-in-italian-cities-for-students:section-7","title":"Check your progress","items":["Room type and number of occupants match the comparison.","Exact address, campus and commute recorded.","Included bills and extra charges written down.","Deposit, advance rent and refund terms understood.","Contract dates cover the actual academic period.","Budget works without an unconfirmed residence allocation."]}],"$undefined",["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for Before accepting a housing quote","children":[["$","$L4","/guides/university-of-padua-admissions-scholarships/",{"href":"/guides/university-of-padua-admissions-scholarships/","children":["Padua study and funding profile",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$8:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L4","/guides/university-of-bologna-admissions-scholarships/",{"href":"/guides/university-of-bologna-admissions-scholarships/","children":["Bologna admissions and funding",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$8:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}]
